      "title": "Part 2：野餐准备与时间",
      "language": "en",
      "kind": "part2",
      "segments": [
        {
          "key": "p2-060/audio/0",
          "text": "Who's bringing the tea for the picnic?"
        },
        {
          "key": "p2-060/options/0/0",
          "text": "We need four tea bags."
        },
        {
          "key": "p2-060/options/1/0",
          "text": "Lunch starts at half past twelve."
        },
        {
          "key": "p2-060/options/2/0",
          "text": "Jill's bringing a pot of tea."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "en-part3",
      "title": "Part 3：预约办公室窗户测量",
      "language": "en",
      "kind": "part3",
      "segments": [
        {
          "key": "p3-g09/turns/0/0",
          "text": "I'd like someone to measure my office windows for new blinds.",
          "speaker": "A"
        },
        {
          "key": "p3-g09/turns/1/0",
          "text": "Our installer can visit on Tuesday morning or Thursday afternoon.",
          "speaker": "B"
        },
        {
          "key": "p3-g09/turns/2/0",
          "text": "Thursday is better because I have meetings all morning on Tuesday.",
          "speaker": "A"
        },
        {
          "key": "p3-g09/turns/3/0",
          "text": "I'll book that visit and send a text with the installer's name.",
          "speaker": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "en-part4",
      "title": "Part 4：商店收银与取货广播",
      "language": "en",
      "kind": "part4",
      "segments": [
        {
          "key": "p4-g01/turns/0/0",
          "text": "Good afternoon, shoppers.",
          "speaker": "A"
        },
        {
          "key": "p4-g01/turns/0/1",
          "text": "Our upstairs checkout is closed for the rest of the day.",
          "speaker": "A"
        },
        {
          "key": "p4-g01/turns/0/2",
          "text": "Please pay for all items at the front counter on the ground floor.",
          "speaker": "A"
        },
        {
          "key": "p4-g01/turns/0/3",
          "text": "If you are picking up an online order, go to the small desk beside the front counter.",
          "speaker": "A"
        },
        {
          "key": "p4-g01/turns/0/4",
          "text": "Have your order number ready.",
          "speaker": "A"
        },
        {
          "key": "p4-g01/turns/0/5",
          "text": "Thank you for shopping with us.",
          "speaker": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
